[{"title":"偶寄林夫","author":"沈辽","text":"南山雪未消，秋浦春太早。\n柳萼为谁开，梅花同我老。\n少年薄游意，落日晴空杳。\n林下寂无人，烟外啼幽鸟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45363,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉送醇老","author":"沈辽","text":"近世考吏师，谁如李荆州。\n斯人不可作，伊洛青松丘。\n江上逢故客，扬名谈旧游。\n蚤被北海荐，不向龙门羞。\n三年州从事，利刀无全牛。\n毁誉岂无人，春梦空悠悠。\n乃知云台栋，当向华岱求。\n潢污一尺水，岂能纵吞舟。\n老夫卧山野，自将麋鹿俦。\n虽云相见晚，笑语欣相投。\n旷不入州府，何由接绸缪。\n江南二月春，坐想颍水流。\n适当及瓜代，哂笑岂不优。\n它年青云路，六翮固已修。\n嵩杪有高士，为记南山幽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45364,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苏武归汉图一首","author":"沈辽","text":"苏武不辱汉廷节，生辞匈奴归北阙。\n胡服椎髻李将军，反袂悲号与武别。\n阴山茫茫天将雪，北风吹旗旗欲裂。\n金瓶酾酒具未设，胡儿解鞍沙上歇。\n使者左骖黄金玦，紫骝白颠推奇骨。\n山前牧羊原野阔，汉日正斜发未〗发。\n从官挥涕不敢谒，掺袪欲究胸中说。\n青海厄穷十九年，来时壮强今白发。\n同行吏士半物故，韬中节旄尽落脱。\n将军鸷忿不可夺，老母已诛族已灭。\n心知罪恶上通天，甘死胡尘同断蘖。\n功名逆顺虽不类，胡汉死生从此决。\n夙昔遗芳在图史，追想山川一骚屑。\n巧工寓意在恍惚，墨妙笔精世称绝。\n唯有千秋不断情，至今亭亭陇头月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45365,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西禅新阁","author":"沈辽","text":"秋浦千万山，苍烟媚高木。\n流髟落浦中，泓澄一川渌。\n江南佳丽地，六代多遗躅。\n不见石城人，空馀琼树曲。\n长围山势壮，不驻如车毂。\n道人敞重阁，却倚山阳麓。\n西江泻轩外，雪浪高如屋。\n未若秋浦佳，平铺绀文縠。\n水中白石烂，汎汎如孤鹜。\n天外九蕖蓉，突兀摇苍玉。\n太白一杯酒，杜郎满头菊。\n千载忽已空，白骨埋荒谷。\n齐山皓发客，逍遥老松竹。\n拿舟试一眺，时方秋气肃。\n飘萧得胜意，远迩穷幽瞩。\n行当乘月来，置榻山头宿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45366,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵酬余君见赠","author":"沈辽","text":"老来无暗亦无明，寄息深山避世情。\n夫子暗投珠玉惠，我身正似一毫轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45367,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉酬伯昌志国所示古调","author":"沈辽","text":"馀景避世欢，栖迟在丘壑。\n公子引车骑，相访南山崿。\n长离舞员嵩，同为九皋鹤。\n晚节虽殊途，彷佛当年乐。\n间关幽鸟哢，凌乱馀花落。\n春风岂有意，群生自回薄。\n夙昔钦二妙，联函得佳作。\n顾予非季子，何足闻古乐。\n葩华玩洒藻，银钩窥雅博。\n故知霄鸿意，不为尘埃铄。\n吾蚤拙世用，投老更衰索。\n惭无锦绣段，何由报金错。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45368,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐山偶题三首 其一","author":"沈辽","text":"杜子风情春水波，至今诗句使人夸。\n不知朽骨犹存否，山上年年黄菊花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45369,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐山偶题三首 其二","author":"沈辽","text":"朝云未散白笴陂，落日已过铜陵西。\n不向人间生皓发，直寻仙客上青溪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45370,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐山偶题三首 其三","author":"沈辽","text":"山腰嵌岩山顶平，此下直眺池阳城。\n城中欢戚自流转，不似山石都无情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45371,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄道辅","author":"沈辽","text":"髯弟南来白发垂，襄阳夫子最相知。\n仓惶河外元戎客，冷落江南夜半棋。\n云外渺瀰帆信隔，秋山重叠驿书迟。\n何缘得与君相会，共醉山前白玉卮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45372,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代人上杭守赵资政生辰诗","author":"沈辽","text":"盛世君臣会，功成在太平。\n一阳迎律至，元老应时生。\n直道升乌府，仁风拥使旌。\n猷为安庙社，惠爱及民氓。\n帖泰三朝事，光华万古名。\n至诚无隐蔽，妙识造圆明。\n爱日恩光布，流泉句偈清。\n邦人祝公寿，龟鹤入蓬瀛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45373,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无柱亭","author":"沈辽","text":"结茅在何处，为屋岂无柱。\n山前巉岩石，四方适中度。\n谁知屋下人，其心亦无柱。\n悠然寄此间，自得无生路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45374,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南漪堂","author":"沈辽","text":"湖上逍遥避百愁，年来频向此中休。\n檐前山势翠相照，床下冰纹清不流。\n萦带夕阳移画舸，留连明月卧前洲。\n高僧会取栖迟意，应有人来怅昔游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45375,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝云丛翠亭","author":"沈辽","text":"群山驾肩东南倾，平湖照眼正中明。\n上人置亭倚绝巘，宝云拂树当前楹。\n春阳未彻地先暖，秋景欲下风已清。\n衰才不足道佳景，聊书丛翠为其名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45376,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"远行","author":"沈辽","text":"少年事远游，迢迢指岐路。\n遥天值秋晏，烟光澹如素。\n寥落淮南山，影入扬子渡。\n出入三十年，久嗟韦带误。\n老来感节物，此意谁与喻。\n独知拥毳坐，无复晨征路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45377,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登览","author":"沈辽","text":"我意欲穷眺，山林蔽四域。\n尔来已彫落，万里情何极。\n古人多悲秋，我念不如默。\n终朝对青山，烟岚有馀色。\n欲上百尺楼，羸躯恐颠侧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45378,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂感","author":"沈辽","text":"咄咄待秋至，秋至安足惊。\n年华去如扫，正如宠与荣。\n区区白驹隙，君子慎所行。\n不如陶渊明，超然自归耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45379,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"村舍","author":"沈辽","text":"西山草庐下，古木蔽中园。\n九月罢亚收，流水满郊原。\n茅茨何所乐，姑无人世喧。\n多谢朝市人，吾方效孤鶱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45380,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"边思","author":"沈辽","text":"西风方折胶，戍兵出已屡。\n赤藏候骑归，翩翩如鸟羽。\n穹庐旧所居，不远横山路。\n汉将知为谁，三军倚全护。\n上赖天子圣，边方无斗捕。\n运筹有馀略，彫弓射狐兔。\n何谢苍头公，回为儿女顾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45381,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"沈辽","text":"秋气已憀慄，况乃阴雨多。\n颜色不衰谢，唯有庭前莎。\n幽窗坐读书，讽古空长哦。\n多谢高世人，辩口如县河。\n干旋白日光，何用鲁阳戈。\n念我无术进，忧愁将奈何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45382,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中","author":"沈辽","text":"朝游白云里，夕憩长松边。\n俯视世间人，但见万井烟。\n流转非一日，正如水潺湲。\n吾方欲高步，嘉遁休中年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45383,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宴集","author":"沈辽","text":"袢暑久拘郁，欣然对秋光。\n薄具招友朋，相与娱中堂。\n清觞味虽薄，果蓏具青黄。\n尤爱檐间竹，风来响琳琅。\n正赖文举贤，坐客乃其常。\n相欢意气间，高韵信轩昂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45384,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怨思","author":"沈辽","text":"幽人有幽怨，其意岂为秋。\n西风多感伤，乃尔增百忧。\n辗转长夜枕，徘徊千尺楼。\n浮生能几时，年华亦易遒。\n傥非拳拳志，谅复何所求。\n天道或难平，此理可信不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45385,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送行","author":"沈辽","text":"昔我来东州，送客满江郭。\n挥涕望井闾，秋怀寄杯酌。\n泛然千里外，秋来意非薄。\n客舍冷潇骚，那复事饰雘。\n游宦非我怀，俯仰令人怍。\n何事脱身去，馀生老丘壑。\n亲朋永相过，焉能事官爵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45386,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陪客游山","author":"沈辽","text":"相从云中去，飞盖云中斜。\n峭岭想员峤，横溪胜若耶。\n岩通新雨溜，林暗残春花。\n缅怀武林兴，梦寐归山家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45387,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"圆明师为余鼓琴作昭君操因感其意辞以赠之","author":"沈辽","text":"王昭君，汉宫女。\n生如桃李花，皖皖托朝露。\n不向春风荣，摧折在泥土。\n耻将黄金市颜色，空得君王一回顾。\n黄门扶我上车去，遥望汉宫隔烟雾。\n十年帘下学画眉，不知还被蛾眉误。\n中间悲怨或易忘，如今羁愁那可谕。\n梦中时复作歌舞，满目异类谁与语。\n胡风日夜惊吹沙，不知春来复秋去。\n一生此恨终难言，独自援琴传作谱。\n传作谱，一曲未终泪如雨。\n我来都城下，黄尘厌羁旅。\n道人为我试一弹，使我超然为怀古。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45388,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词十首 其一","author":"卢秉","text":"絮扑芙蓉苑，华开太液波。\n黄头吹月笛，棹影落天河。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45389,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词十首 其二","author":"卢秉","text":"草浅天边碧，花匀日脚红。\n须知亲帝泽，不必藉春工。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45390,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词十首 其三","author":"卢秉","text":"花萼蜂儿影，帘旗燕子风。\n游丝避金葆，吹过紫垣东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45391,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词十首 其四","author":"卢秉","text":"翠环双凤带，小队五花蹄。\n十二龙钩卷，梨花烂漫时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45392,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词十首 其五","author":"卢秉","text":"花蒂流金水，知从秘苑来。\n春风如解意，不敢起纤埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45393,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词十首 其六","author":"卢秉","text":"粉蝶非仙骨，随风过苑墙。\n穿花不敢采，应怯内家香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45394,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词十首 其七","author":"卢秉","text":"沉沉雨过宫槐绿，寂寂春残辇路香。\n细想人间无此景，夜来魂梦到昭阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45395,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词十首 其十","author":"卢秉","text":"落絮濛濛立夏天，楼前槐影叶初圆。\n传闻紫殿深深处，便有薰风入舜弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45396,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送中济侍郎帅庆得乘字","author":"杜纯","text":"羌马轶河西，诏下绝贡聘。\n自是封疆臣，都俞命弥敬。\n莫如小司徒，钦哉往临庆。\n貔貅十万人，大半爵公乘。\n恩将怀其心，威足系其颈。\n牧无南向尘，指挥罔不定。\n边氓歌夜耕，更续公刘政。\n今日燕西园，愧接儒林盛。\n阳关断谁肠，笑把金钟听。\n家世本诗书，无劳霍去病。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45397,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆善寺圆照堂题咏","author":"王兢","text":"佛心开晦瞑，觉竹极融明。\n实相自然见，客尘何处生。\n铜瓶秋水净，草坐月华清。\n不必曹溪去，穿云振锡行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45398,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游藏春坞用坡韵复题其后","author":"释了元","text":"门掩青春春自饶，未容取次老僧敲。\n输他蜂蝶无情物，相逐偷香过柳梢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45399,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题茶诗与东坡","author":"释了元","text":"穿云摘尽社前春，一两平分半与君。\n遇客不须容易点，点茶须是吃茶人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45400,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长歌","author":"释了元","text":"野鸟啼，野鸟啼时时有思。\n有思春气桃花发，春气桃花发满枝。\n满枝莺雀相呼唤，莺雀相呼唤岩畔。\n岩畔花红似锦屏，花红似锦屏堪看。\n堪看山，山秀丽，秀丽山前烟雾起。\n山前烟雾起清浮，清浮浪促潺湲水。\n浪促潺湲水景幽，景幽深处好，深处好追游。\n追游傍水花，傍水花似雪，似雪梨花光皎洁。\n梨花光皎洁玲珑，玲珑似坠银花折。\n似坠银花折最好，最好柔茸溪畔草。\n柔茸溪畔草青青，双双蝴蝶飞来到。\n蝴蝶飞来列落花，落花林里鸟啼叫。\n林里鸟啼叫不休，不休为忆春光好。\n为忆春光好杨柳，杨柳枝枝春色秀。\n春色秀时常共饮，时常共饮春浓酒。\n春浓酒似醉，似醉闲行春色里。\n闲行春色里相逢，相逢竞忆游山水。\n竞忆游山水心息，心息悠悠归去来，归去来休休役役。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45401,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答可遵","author":"释了元","text":"打睡禅和万万千，梦中趋利走如烟。\n劝君打快修禅定，老境如蚕已再眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45402,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄刘凝之中允","author":"释了元","text":"庐山南面落星滨，八十清强致仕人。\n天下共推为大老，皇家不得作忠臣。\n云栖高锁真空月，竹洞深藏觉苑春。\n莫道神仙便无事，赤心长是念斯民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45403,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自为像赞","author":"释了元","text":"李公天下石麒麟，传得云居道者真。\n不为拈华明人事，等闲开口笑何人。\n泥牛漫向风前嗅，枯木无端雪里春。\n对现堂堂俱不识，太平时代自由身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45404,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释了元","text":"赵州当日少谦光，不出三门见赵王。\n争似金山无量相，大千都是一禅床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45405,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戒杀文","author":"释了元","text":"鳞甲材毛诸品类，众生与佛心无二。\n只为当时错用心，致使今生头角异。\n水中游，林里戏，何忍将来充日计。\n磨刀着火或研齑，口不能言眼还觑。\n或槌磕，或刀刺，牵入镬汤深可畏。\n㷟燖毛羽括皮鳞，刮脊剜心犹吐气。\n美君喉，誇好味，劝子劝妻言俊利。\n只知恣性纵无明，不惧阴司毫发记。\n命才终，冤对至，面睹阎王争敢讳。\n从头一一报无差，炉戾镬汤何处避。\n劝贤豪，须戒忌，莫把众生当容易。\n食他一脔脔还他，古圣留言终不伪。\n戒杀兼能买放生，免入阿鼻无问地。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45406,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古联珠","author":"释了元","text":"尘中辩主眼分明，特地寻方更点睛。\n堪笑耆婆虽暝眩，至今南北绝人行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45407,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"焦山三诏洞","author":"释了元","text":"畴昔先生此掩关，紫泥三到石房间。\n若教便逐蒲轮起，安得清风镇海山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45408,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游云门","author":"释了元","text":"一阵若邪溪上雨，雨过荷花香满路。\n拖筇纵步入松门，寺在白云堆里住。\n老僧却笑寻茶具，旋汲寒泉煮玉乳。\n睡魔惊散毛骨清，坐看秦峰秋月午。\n月明山鸟乱相呼，松杉竹影半窗户。\n令人彻晓忆匡庐，作诗先寄江南去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45409,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"释了元","text":"子瞻船上带家来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45410,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"释了元","text":"龙枝已逐风雷变，减却虚窗半日凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45411,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"释了元","text":"红裙蘸碧波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45412,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"释了元","text":"藕断鹭鸶飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45413,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"投韩太祝","author":"释了元","text":"公子乘闲卧绛幮，白衣老吏慢寒儒。\n不知梦见周公否，曾说当时吐哺无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45414,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题江干初雪图","author":"释了元","text":"此身何补一毫芒，三辱清时政事堂。\n病骨未为山下土，尚寻遗墨话存亡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45415,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沂山龙祠祈雨有应","author":"释了元","text":"南山高峻嶒，北山亦崷崒，坐看两山云出没。\n行如驱，归若呼，始觉山中有灵物。\n郁郁其焚兰，覃覃其击鼓，祝屡云云巫屡舞。\n我民无罪神所怜，一夜雷风三尺雨。\n岭木兮苍苍，溪泉兮央央，决云散诸峰互明灭。\n东阡西陌农事忙，庙闲山空音响绝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45416,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答苏子由","author":"释了元","text":"匕饭盘蔬强少留，相逢何物可消忧。\n缘君未得酒中趣，与我漫为方外游。\n草乱不容移马迹，山雄全欲逼城楼。\n济时异日须公等，莫狎翩翩海上鸥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45417,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午帖子","author":"释了元","text":"艾叶成人后，榴花结子初。\n江心新得镜，龙瑞护仙居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45418,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和赐后苑金橘","author":"释了元","text":"苑臣初摘置雕盘，口敕宣恩赐近官。\n气味岂同淮枳变，皮肤不作楚梅酸。\n参差翠叶藏珠琲，错落黄金铸弹丸。\n安得一株擎雨露，画图传与世人看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45419,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送刘贡父悴海陵","author":"释了元","text":"吾侪客京师，晨夕厌欢聒。\n僦舍八九椽，郁溽增烦渴。\n有如辙中鱼，噞喁不可活。\n百鸟趋高门，䟃?互挥喝。\n论辩苦难裁，气焰欻相夺。\n所丧或捐躯，所得未易撮。\n我闻江湖间，连山翠如抹。\n山下走沧波，山巅富松栝。\n凫鸭乱菰蒲，鱼鼋聚坡堨。\n世事剧飞电，人生真漂沫。\n谁其违乐游，而此卷颦额。\n君直秘书阁，日趋黄金闼。\n忽思云水行，飘然谁能遏。\n朝出都门东，襟胸迥披豁。\n放舟下淮楚，天地顿空阔。\n莫苦道路难，暑令恍已末。\n君看日月疾，俯仰换裘葛。\n无谓监州微，孔孟犹短褐。\n时来发光华，春阳奋枯蘖。\n惟君饱才术，流辈服颖脱。\n早作归朝期，岂学弦与筈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45420,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"释了元","text":"紫蟹黄柑新酒熟，夜间船尾唱伊州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45421,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六首 其一","author":"释净端","text":"本是潇湘一钓客，自东自西自南北。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45422,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六首 其二","author":"释净端","text":"章惇章惇，请我看坟。\n我却吃素，汝却吃荤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45423,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六首 其三","author":"释净端","text":"章公好学仙，吕公好坐禅。\n徐六喻檐板，各自见一边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45424,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六首 其四","author":"释净端","text":"村里师子村里弄，眉毛与眼一齐动。\n开却口，肚里直笼统，不爱人取奉。\n直饶弄列帝王宫，也是一场乾打鬨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45425,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]